<%@ taglib prefix="seal" uri="https://arte.or.kr/seal/functions" %>
<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>동의 요청 상세</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/admin-data.css?v=20260906-3"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/recipient-request.css?v=20260907-2"></head><body class="admin-body"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/header.jsp"/><div class="admin-layout"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/sidebar.jsp"/><main class="admin-main">
<div class="page-heading-row"><div><p class="section-kicker">REQUEST DETAIL</p><h1><c:out value="${request.requestCode()}"/></h1><p><span class="request-state state-${request.status()}"><c:out value="${seal:statusLabel('request', request.status())}"/></span></p></div><div class="page-heading-buttons"><c:if test="${request.status() == 'DRAFT'}"><a class="primary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/edit">초안 수정</a></c:if><a class="secondary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests">목록</a></div></div>
<c:if test="${not empty notice}"><p class="alert"><c:out value="${notice}"/></p></c:if><section class="work-panel"><dl class="detail-list"><div><dt>대상자</dt><dd><c:out value="${recipient.maskedName()}"/> · <c:out value="${recipient.maskedEmail()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>만료일시</dt><dd><c:out value="${seal:dateTime(request.expiresAt())}"/></dd></div><div><dt>동의서 양식</dt><dd class="template-reference"><c:choose><c:when test="${not empty requestTemplate}"><strong><c:out value="${requestTemplate.templateName()}"/></strong><span><c:out value="${requestTemplate.templateCode()}"/> · v<c:out value="${requestTemplate.versionNumber()}"/></span><small>버전 ID <c:out value="${request.templateVersionId()}"/></small></c:when><c:otherwise><strong>동의서 양식 정보 확인 불가</strong><small>버전 ID <c:out value="${request.templateVersionId()}"/></small></c:otherwise></c:choose></dd></div><div><dt>수신자 정보 등록 근거</dt><dd><c:out value="${empty recipient.collectionBasis() ? '확인 불가' : recipient.collectionBasis()}"/></dd></div></dl><c:if test="${not empty request.snapshotId()}"><p><a class="secondary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/preview">발행 동의서 보기</a></p></c:if></section>
<section class="request-actions request-delivery-actions">
<c:if test="${request.status() == 'DRAFT'}"><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/finalize"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="versionNo" value="${request.versionNo()}"><button class="primary-button">내용 확정</button></form></c:if>
<c:if test="${request.status() == 'READY'}"><form class="request-operation-form request-schedule-form" method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/deliver"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="versionNo" value="${request.versionNo()}"><label class="request-field">발송 예약 <span class="optional-text">(선택)</span><input class="schedule-input" type="text" name="scheduledAt" aria-describedby="schedule-help" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="예: 2026-08-31 09:00" pattern="[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}"></label><button class="primary-button">HTML 이메일 발송 등록</button><p id="schedule-help" class="request-schedule-help">비워두면 즉시 발송 대상으로 등록됩니다. 예약일시를 입력하면 해당 시각 이후 발송됩니다.<br>자동 발송이 중지된 경우에는 발송 대기 상태로 유지됩니다.</p></form></c:if>
<c:if test="${request.status() == 'ACTIVE'}"><form class="request-operation-form request-schedule-form" method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/redeliver"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="versionNo" value="${request.versionNo()}"><label class="request-field">재발송 예약 <span class="optional-text">(선택)</span><input class="schedule-input" type="text" name="scheduledAt" aria-describedby="schedule-help" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="예: 2026-08-31 09:00" pattern="[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2} [0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}"></label><button class="secondary-button">링크 재발급·메일 등록</button><p id="schedule-help" class="request-schedule-help">비워두면 즉시 발송 대상으로 등록됩니다. 예약일시를 입력하면 해당 시각 이후 발송됩니다.<br>자동 발송이 중지된 경우에는 발송 대기 상태로 유지됩니다.</p></form></c:if>
<c:if test="${request.status() == 'DRAFT' or request.status() == 'READY' or request.status() == 'ACTIVE'}"><form class="cancel-request" method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/requests/${request.requestId()}/cancel"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="versionNo" value="${request.versionNo()}"><label class="request-field">취소 사유<input name="reason" minlength="5" maxlength="500" required></label><button class="secondary-button">요청 취소</button></form></c:if>
<c:if test="${request.status() == 'COMPLETED'}"><a class="secondary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/evidence/request/${request.requestId()}">완료 동의 증적 보기</a></c:if></section></main></div></body></html>
